SUMMARY:Hereditary (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Horror\, Mystery\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.3/10\\n\\nAri Aster's devastating debut. A family unravels after a tragedy — what starts as grief becomes something far more terrifying. One of the most unsettling horror films of the decade.
