DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260904
SUMMARY:Nope (2022)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Horror\, Science Fiction\\nRating: 6.825/10\\n\\nJordan Peele's most ambitious frame — a UFO Western about the compulsion to look. Hoyte van Hoytema shoots the sky as threat. The spectacle commentary is baked into the spectacle.
UID:211f13504586efaefa44672649032835@jellyfin-films
