DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260904
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
SUMMARY:Infernal Affairs (2002)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Action\, Thriller\, Crime\, Mystery\\nRating: 7.808/10\\n\\nA cop inside the mob and a mole inside the police. The film Scorsese remade as The Departed — the original is tighter\, colder\, and more elegant.
UID:2e52c17de241829b140399618ce929e7@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
