BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260906
SUMMARY:Old Days (2016)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Documentary\\nRating: 6.6/10\\n\\nA nearly two-hour documentary about the making of Park Chan-wook's Oldboy\, featuring intimate interviews with cast and crew revisiting key locations. Essential viewing for anyone interested in the craft behind Korean cinema.
UID:e7452400e3249314542e7d301e6ab7d6@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
