BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260906
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260907
SUMMARY:In Bruges (2008)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Comedy\, Drama\, Crime\\nRating: 7.499/10\\n\\nTwo hitmen hiding in a medieval Belgian city. Martin McDonagh's dialogue is theater — every exchange is a duel. Colin Farrell's performance is the funniest sad thing you'll watch.
UID:fe1a7af4ebe829ba585883408450aa63@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
