DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:The Dreamers (2003)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Romance\\nRating: 7.177/10\\n\\nBertolucci traps three film lovers in a Paris apartment during 1968. The cinephilia is the seduction — they reenact classic films as foreplay. The politics are outside\; the cinema is inside.
UID:210f37592195b2ce4fe14e51dd0f7de2@jellyfin-films
