DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260911
SUMMARY:Steins\;Gate Live Stage Adptation  (2022)
DESCRIPTION:\\nA remarkably inventive stage adaptation that uses a rotating set to translate a branching visual novel into live performance. Each show featured a different route\, with the final one chosen by audience vote.
