SUMMARY:The Outlaws (2017)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Crime\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.652/10\\n\\nMa Dong-seok brings his fists to a Chinatown gang war. Korean crime action where the star's physical charisma IS the filmmaking — every punch has a personality.
