SUMMARY:The Terror Live (2013)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Crime\, Drama\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.167/10\\n\\nA news anchor broadcasts a terrorist bombing live and becomes a negotiator. Set almost entirely in one studio — Ha Jung-woo carries the film on vocal performance alone.
