BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:Split (2016)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Horror\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.341/10\\n\\nJames McAvoy plays 23 personalities and makes each physically distinct — the posture changes\, the voice shifts\, the eyes alter. Shyamalan gives him a stage and he fills it.
UID:3e4ee5cbd5d87b0b80a0517b5c8e6a02@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Ip Man 3 (2015)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Drama\, History\\nRating: 7.037/10\\n\\nWing Chun versus Mike Tyson's boxing. The real fight\, though\, is domestic — Ip Man's wife is ill\, and the film earns its emotional weight alongside its action.
UID:3ba86283f189f157416a5a7cc8416551@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:Gravity (2013)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Science Fiction\, Thriller\, Drama\\nRating: 7.172/10\\n\\nCuarón and Lubezki create a thirteen-minute opening shot in space that redefines what a camera can do. Sandra Bullock's breathing is the soundtrack. The silence IS the terror.
UID:333f63c71f1f44757f4c0e7602b04f24@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
