DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:Moon Young (2015)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 6.7/10
UID:af6650d009d6c5d69c69e3027d430455@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261006
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261007
SUMMARY:Everything Everywhere All at Once (2022)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Adventure\, Science Fiction\\nRating: 7.72/10\\n\\nThe Daniels use multiverse theory to tell a story about a mother and daughter. The visual invention is relentless — every universe has its own visual grammar. Ke Huy Quan's return is extraordinary.
UID:d116fec1155aa9cc1a251d6a214583dc@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261008
SUMMARY:Thirst (2009)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Horror\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.1/10\\n\\nPark Chan-wook turns a priest into a vampire. The genre shift is the provocation — faith\, desire\, and blood filmed with the same operatic precision as his revenge trilogy.
UID:3e276e51a824436bcd05f56afc51cf0f@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:Masaan (2015)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 7.103/10\\n\\nTwo stories in Varanasi — a woman caught in a raid and a low-caste boy in love. Neeraj Ghaywan films the ghats and burning pyres with the kind of beauty that makes sorrow visible.
UID:e2ebfbc59c75ada30393a4e8169248ea@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
SUMMARY:Mandy (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Fantasy\, Horror\\nRating: 6.208/10\\n\\nNicolas Cage\, a chainsaw duel\, and Panos Cosmatos painting every frame in crimson and indigo. The first half is slow-burn psychedelia\; the second is operatic vengeance. The color grading is the narrative.
UID:459144bf7e72aaafc88bf847eb7d649a@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
