DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:The Host (2006)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Horror\, Science Fiction\\nRating: 6.974/10\\n\\nBong Joon-ho's monster film is really a family comedy\, a political satire\, and a chase movie simultaneously. The creature design is practical and weighty — it feels real.
