DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:Lady Snowblood (1973)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Crime\, Drama\\nRating: 7.52/10\\n\\nA woman born in prison\, raised for revenge. The film Tarantino studied for Kill Bill — Fujita's use of color\, blood on snow\, is operatic. Meiko Kaji is magnetic.
UID:b50c03e1d8a95da3810148fedfcd68ef@jellyfin-films
