BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:The Farewell (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Comedy\, Drama\\nRating: 7.417/10\\n\\nA Chinese family stages a fake wedding to gather around a grandmother who doesn't know she's dying. Lulu Wang balances comedy and grief like they're the same breath.
UID:2725df92875218cc25b91680394aa765@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
