BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:Fight Club (1999)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Thriller\\nRating: 8.438/10\\n\\nFincher builds a world out of IKEA catalogs and testosterone and then asks what it's actually made of. The visual grammar — subliminal frames\, narrator unreliability — is baked into the cinematography.
UID:3ab26a680c871afd1bf61ee34d8f1b87@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
