DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 7.417/10\\n\\nA warmly photographed period drama based on a true story\, bathed in the bright colors of four seasons across an idyllic 1980s Korean mountain village. Draws its power from quiet conviction rather than sentimentality.
