DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Boyhood (2014)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 7.493/10\\n\\nLinklater filmed the same actor for twelve years. The absence of drama IS the drama — growing up is just accumulation. Time is the special effect.
