SUMMARY:Sairat (2016)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Romance\\nRating: 7.6/10\\n\\nA lower-caste boy and an upper-caste girl elope. Nagraj Manjule directs the Marathi countryside with panoramic beauty and furious honesty about caste. The film became a cultural earthquake — Marathi cinema's biggest hit\, and for good reason.
