SUMMARY:Before Sunset (2004)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Romance\\nRating: 7.809/10\\n\\nThey meet again in Paris\, nine years later\, in real time. The single-take walking conversations build toward a final scene that contains an entire relationship in one gesture.
