SUMMARY:Anand (1971)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 6.928/10\\n\\nRajesh Khanna's most luminous performance — a terminally ill man who insists on joy. The dialogue by Gulzar is quotable decades later. Bollywood before Bollywood became a formula.
UID:3c9ec8e91f5effa3c02bc02965350eae@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
