DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270509
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270510
SUMMARY:Love Exposure (2008)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Comedy\, Drama\, Romance\\nRating: 7.922/10\\n\\nA four-hour epic where a Catholic boy becomes a master upskirt photographer to rebel against his priest father\, then falls in love with a girl who hates all men. That premise sounds like a joke — the film plays it with the emotional sincerity of a cathedral. Sono's masterpiece and one of the most ambitious love stories ever committed to film.
UID:d88dcac81c6828ef6ff5825ef4eb8062@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
