SUMMARY:Nomadland (2020)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 7.174/10\\n\\nChloé Zhao embeds Frances McDormand among real nomads. The non-actors are the texture — their stories are documentary\, the framing is cinema. Joshua James Richards shoots the American West as elegy.
UID:14a19f8f7ab1a8d37d1e11abb353412d@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
