DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270512
SUMMARY:Burning (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Mystery\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.375/10\\n\\nLee Chang-dong adapts Murakami into a slow-burn class study. Steven Yeun's smile is the most unsettling thing in Korean cinema. The ambiguity is the point.
UID:6416083702b240b79c0ccca1d0b2b88e@jellyfin-films
DTSTAMP:20260823T074754Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
