DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270513
SUMMARY:Unbreakable (2000)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Mystery\, Thriller\\nRating: 7.143/10\\n\\nShyamalan's most restrained film — a superhero origin story told at the pace of a drama. The color coding\, the long takes\, and Willis's stillness make the genre feel literary.
