SUMMARY:Cloverfield (2008)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Action\, Thriller\, Science Fiction\\nRating: 6.72/10\\n\\nA monster attacks New York\, seen entirely through a partygoer's handheld camera. The found-footage format works because the scale of destruction is real — the Statue of Liberty's head rolls down a street.
