SUMMARY:The Eye (2002)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Horror\\nRating: 6.561/10\\n\\nA blind woman receives a corneal transplant and begins seeing things the dead left behind. The Pang Brothers build dread through what's barely visible at the edge of the frame.
