SUMMARY:Mom (2017)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\\nRating: 4/10\\n\\nSridevi's final film — a mother takes justice into her own hands. The thriller mechanics work\, but Sridevi's performance is the reason — every emotion passes through her eyes before it reaches the screen.
