SUMMARY:Moon (2009)
DESCRIPTION:Genre: Drama\, Science Fiction\\nRating: 7.565/10\\n\\nSam Rockwell alone on a lunar mining base. Duncan Jones builds tension from isolation and routine — the set design is analog and tactile. Rockwell gives three performances in one.
